WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.766 --> 00:00:06.800
Kie! Froakie!

2
00:00:09.266 --> 00:00:12.233
- Pika! Pika!
- Great stuff! Just like that!

3
00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:16.400
- Wow, they’re really pumped up!
- Froakie’s moving faster than ever!

4
00:00:16.466 --> 00:00:20.400
Looks like they’re really excited about their Gym battle against Korrina!

5
00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:22.766
- Na-na-na!
- Oh, yeah! Sure!

6
00:00:22.833 --> 00:00:25.300
I’ll beat Korrina and get that Gym badge!

7
00:00:25.366 --> 00:00:27.166
- Fro!
- Pika!

8
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.299
- Fro?
- Pikachu!

9
00:00:32.366 --> 00:00:36.233
Froakie! Kie!

10
00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:41.300
- What move was that?
- That was Cut!

11
00:00:41.366 --> 00:00:43.833
Wow, Froakie, you learned how to use Cut?

12
00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:46.833
- Fro? Kie! Kie!
- Pika! Pika!

13
00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:50.466
Froakie must have learned that move while trying to save Pikachu!

14
00:00:50.533 --> 00:00:54.533
Yeah! Wanting to help Pikachu uncovered more of Froakie’s hidden talents!

15
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:56.500
Woo-hoo!

16
00:00:56.566 --> 00:00:59.800
You’re right. First time I met Froakie,

17
00:00:59.866 --> 00:01:03.600
it jumped in when Team Rocket was trying to steal Pikachu!

18
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:11.000
Awesome! Thanks for giving Pikachu a hand like that!

19
00:01:11.066 --> 00:01:12.066
Froakie!

20
00:01:12.133 --> 00:01:15.800
Hey, Ash? A Double Battle might be a really interesting way

21
00:01:15.866 --> 00:01:19.133
- for you to train with Froakie!
- Double Battle?

22
00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.400
Because Froakie learned a new move while helping Pikachu,

23
00:01:22.466 --> 00:01:24.966
a Double Battle might result in more of the same!

24
00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:28.633
Yeah, I’m totally up for that! Will you have a Double Battle with me?

25
00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:31.966
- Of course!
- Fro! Fro!

26
00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:34.900
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

27
00:01:34.966 --> 00:01:38.466
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

28
00:01:38.533 --> 00:01:41.266
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

29
00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:44.266
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

30
00:01:44.333 --> 00:01:47.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

31
00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:50.366
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

32
00:01:50.433 --> 00:01:53.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

33
00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:56.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

34
00:01:56.433 --> 00:01:58.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

35
00:01:58.933 --> 00:02:02.000
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon! ♪

36
00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.700
In preparation for his Gym battle against Korrina,

37
00:02:15.766 --> 00:02:19.500
Ash is training hard, agreeing to have a Double Battle with Clemont.

38
00:02:19.566 --> 00:02:22.266
Here’s my first Pokémon. Huh?

39
00:02:24.866 --> 00:02:29.933
- Chespin! Ches! Pin! Pin!
- Chespin! You’re ready to go, huh?

40
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:33.433
Okay, then, your partner is right here!

41
00:02:34.900 --> 00:02:36.200
- Bunnelby!
- Yeah!

42
00:02:36.266 --> 00:02:42.033
Okay! Now, Froakie’s partner’s going to be.... Hawlucha, I choose you!

43
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.333
Hawlucha!

44
00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:49.966
Hawlucha, Froakie, we’re having a Double Battle.

45
00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.966
So make sure you really help each other out!

46
00:02:53.033 --> 00:02:55.333
- Kie!
- Lucha, Lucha.

47
00:02:57.466 --> 00:03:00.500
- Kie?
- Hawlucha wants to work together!

48
00:03:00.566 --> 00:03:04.400
- Froakie! Kie. Fro!
- Yeah! That’s just what I like to see!

49
00:03:04.466 --> 00:03:08.666
Okay, everybody! It's Double Battle time! Yeah!

50
00:03:10.466 --> 00:03:13.466
- All right, here I come!
- Ready when you are!

51
00:03:13.533 --> 00:03:17.366
Now, Chespin, use Tackle! And Bunnelby, use Double Slap!

52
00:03:17.433 --> 00:03:19.466
Hawlucha! Froakie! Dodge it!

53
00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:21.633
Che!

54
00:03:22.633 --> 00:03:23.933
Che?

55
00:03:24.766 --> 00:03:28.433
Bunnelby!

56
00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:32.066
There it is. Hawlucha’s testing its opponent’s strength again.

57
00:03:34.033 --> 00:03:35.966
Fro?

58
00:03:36.033 --> 00:03:41.533
Okay! It’s our turn! Froakie, use Bubble! Hawlucha, rapid-fire Karate Chop!

59
00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:45.500
All right, Chespin, use Vine Whip!

60
00:03:45.566 --> 00:03:48.266
Bunnelby, you battle back with Double Slap!

61
00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:50.033
Che! Che-che-che-che!

62
00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.966
- Lucha!
- Whoa!

63
00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:57.166
Lu-cha!

64
00:03:57.233 --> 00:03:58.933
Oh!

65
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:01.366
- Yay!
- Na-na!

66
00:04:01.433 --> 00:04:04.500
Wow! This is the kind of dramatic battling Hawlucha loves!

67
00:04:04.566 --> 00:04:06.633
- Yeah! Way to go, Hawlucha!
- Pika.

68
00:04:08.666 --> 00:04:11.633
But Froakie doesn’t seem to like this battle at all.

69
00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.800
It’s normal when battling to avoid taking damage.

70
00:04:14.866 --> 00:04:16.633
Hawlucha’s style is unusual.

71
00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.033
Cha-ah!

72
00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:24.300
Keep up the pressure with Mud Shot!

73
00:04:24.366 --> 00:04:28.600
Froakie! Use Water Pulse! Help out Hawlucha!

74
00:04:33.066 --> 00:04:34.866
- Cha. Cha-ha!
- Fro.

75
00:04:34.933 --> 00:04:36.600
Hawlucha, what’s wrong?

76
00:04:36.666 --> 00:04:39.866
I think Hawlucha doesn’t want Froakie getting in its way.

77
00:04:39.933 --> 00:04:42.466
- Is that true, Hawlucha?
- Cha!

78
00:04:42.533 --> 00:04:44.100
Fro!

79
00:04:44.166 --> 00:04:46.966
Now’s our chance! Chespin, use Pin Missile!

80
00:04:47.033 --> 00:04:48.466
Chespin!

81
00:04:48.533 --> 00:04:50.500
Okay, Froakie! Dodge it, quick!

82
00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.766
Huh?

83
00:04:57.033 --> 00:05:00.366
- Way to go, Froakie!
- Hawlucha! Cha!

84
00:05:00.433 --> 00:05:02.600
Froakie, Froakie.

85
00:05:02.666 --> 00:05:06.800
- Lucha!
- Huh?

86
00:05:06.866 --> 00:05:08.533
Ha-cha!

87
00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:10.666
- Oh!
- Hawlucha, what was that?

88
00:05:14.566 --> 00:05:17.033
Hawlucha!

89
00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:19.266
- Froakie, stop!
- Please!

90
00:05:19.333 --> 00:05:22.266
- Come on! Quit it!
- Calm down right now, you two!

91
00:05:24.533 --> 00:05:28.066
Huh?

92
00:05:28.133 --> 00:05:29.666
- Huh?
- Kie! Fro!

93
00:05:29.733 --> 00:05:31.533
Hey, both of you!

94
00:05:32.966 --> 00:05:35.400
- Knock it off!
- Huh?

95
00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:41.433
You two are on the same team! You’re supposed to help each other out!

96
00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:44.466
- Froakie.
- Ha-ha-lu.

97
00:05:46.233 --> 00:05:48.466
- Froakie! Kie! Fro!
- Lu-lu-cha!

98
00:05:51.266 --> 00:05:54.400
- I told you two to quit it!
- Pika, Pikachu.

99
00:05:54.466 --> 00:05:57.200
All right. It looks like this battle’s over.

100
00:05:57.266 --> 00:06:00.266
I think it’s special training time.

101
00:06:00.333 --> 00:06:03.700
I’ll put something together specially for the two of you.

102
00:06:03.766 --> 00:06:06.266
- Man!

103
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:12.266
Ready? You’re going to cover each other’s weak points

104
00:06:12.333 --> 00:06:16.433
and strengthen each other’s strong points, because you’re partners!

105
00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.800
- Lucha!
- Huh?

106
00:06:19.866 --> 00:06:21.433
Ha-lu-cha-cha-lu.

107
00:06:22.733 --> 00:06:24.200
Ha-lu-cha-cha.

108
00:06:24.266 --> 00:06:26.733
Good idea! First, you need to make up.

109
00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.500
- Fro!
- Cha-lu-ha-lu-cha!

110
00:06:29.566 --> 00:06:33.033
Come on. Calm down! Froakie, make up, please!

111
00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.233
-Oh, no!

112
00:06:36.233 --> 00:06:39.600
What we’re going to use now is a two-Pokémon combo move!

113
00:06:39.666 --> 00:06:42.133
I want to start with Hawlucha’s Flying Press

114
00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:46.066
and then add Froakie’s Cut and here’s how it goes!

115
00:06:46.133 --> 00:06:48.900
First, Froakie rides on Hawlucha’s back.

116
00:06:48.966 --> 00:06:54.233
Next, Hawlucha makes a big jump, then Froakie jumps and uses Cut

117
00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:57.466
and that’s when Hawlucha goes into Flying Press!

118
00:06:57.533 --> 00:07:01.166
I think we’re going to call this move the Super Flying Cut!

119
00:07:01.233 --> 00:07:03.900
- Pika!
- Ha-lu-cha-cha-cha!

120
00:07:03.966 --> 00:07:06.733
- Fro! Froakie!
- Okay. Let’s try it!

121
00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:13.866
Lunch is ready, guys!

122
00:07:13.933 --> 00:07:19.066
Here! Homemade Poké Puffs!

123
00:07:20.400 --> 00:07:22.866
Ta-da!

124
00:07:22.933 --> 00:07:26.066
- Oh!
- Oh, no! The Poké Puffs are gone!

125
00:07:26.133 --> 00:07:31.766
But how? I know I put them in here. All right. Who took the Poké Puffs?

126
00:07:34.133 --> 00:07:37.400
- Somebody took them!
- You’d better tell us the truth!

127
00:07:37.466 --> 00:07:40.600
Well, even if nobody will admit it, I’ll know.

128
00:07:40.666 --> 00:07:44.500
I put in those super-spicy Poké Puffs Fennekin loves so much

129
00:07:44.566 --> 00:07:49.066
and right about now, things should start heating up in a big, big way!

130
00:07:51.866 --> 00:07:55.933
- You! Chespin! So it was you, after all!
- Poké Puff thief!

131
00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:59.500
Ches! Chespin! Che!

132
00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:04.900
All right! Try Super Flying Cut once more!

133
00:08:04.966 --> 00:08:07.066
- Cha!
- Fro!

134
00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:17.733
Goofed again! This isn’t going well at all.

135
00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:18.800
Pika!

136
00:08:18.866 --> 00:08:23.066
- Ha-cha-ha-cha-lu-ha-cha!
- Froakie! Fro! Froakie!

137
00:08:25.500 --> 00:08:28.300
- Stop it! Not again!
- Pika!

138
00:08:28.366 --> 00:08:31.200
Try to be a little friendlier.

139
00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.799
Sounds like you two are hungry? Wait a sec.

140
00:08:36.866 --> 00:08:39.566
Here! I’ve got some Oran Berries.

141
00:08:42.266 --> 00:08:44.566
- Lucha!
- Froakie!

142
00:08:44.633 --> 00:08:46.700
Good food makes you feel good, right?

143
00:08:46.766 --> 00:08:49.966
- Now, let’s give that move another try!
- Pika!

144
00:08:50.033 --> 00:08:52.633
- Ha!
- Froakie!

145
00:08:56.533 --> 00:08:58.266
- Cha?
- Froakie!

146
00:08:58.333 --> 00:09:01.200
Great! And this time we’ll make it work!

147
00:09:01.266 --> 00:09:05.000
Use Super Flying--

148
00:09:05.066 --> 00:09:07.633
- Oh!
- Froakie!

149
00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:10.533
- Huh?
- It's Ash!

150
00:09:12.966 --> 00:09:14.766
Pikachu!

151
00:09:17.633 --> 00:09:19.933
- Pika? Pika!
- Huh?

152
00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:28.100
- Pikachu!
- Chespin! Pin Missile, go!

153
00:09:28.166 --> 00:09:29.866
Che!

154
00:09:29.933 --> 00:09:32.733
Chespin!

155
00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:35.100
Fennekin! Use Scratch!

156
00:09:35.166 --> 00:09:37.133
Oh! Pika!

157
00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.233
- Pika! Pika!
- Huh?

158
00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:42.400
Hey, what is that scary noise?

159
00:09:42.466 --> 00:09:47.566
All right! Who did this, anyway?

160
00:09:47.633 --> 00:09:49.300
Huh?

161
00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.100
Huh? Oh!

162
00:10:04.466 --> 00:10:06.400
- Halu!
- Froakie!

163
00:10:07.400 --> 00:10:09.400
- Ha! Hachu!
- Fro!

164
00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:17.700
- Hey, the noise stopped!
- Where are Ash and the others?

165
00:10:17.766 --> 00:10:21.266
- This could be the work of a Pokémon.
- A Pokémon?

166
00:10:21.333 --> 00:10:25.166
Right. I’ve heard stories about a Pokémon who controls trees

167
00:10:25.233 --> 00:10:27.933
and catches people who hurt the forest and eats them up!

168
00:10:28.000 --> 00:10:32.933
But then that means... Ash could be eaten, too!

169
00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:37.400
Pi! Pi! Pika-Pika!

170
00:10:37.466 --> 00:10:40.200
Pi! Pi!

171
00:10:40.266 --> 00:10:42.000
- Pika! Pi! Pika!
- Look!

172
00:10:42.066 --> 00:10:45.933
- Pikachu must have picked up Ash’s scent!
- Let’s hurry!

173
00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.800
Who’s that Pokémon?

174
00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:55.166
It’s Trevenant!

175
00:11:08.566 --> 00:11:10.733
Froakie!

176
00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:14.000
Huh?

177
00:11:15.833 --> 00:11:18.200
- Cha, ha, cha, ha!
- Froakie! Kie!

178
00:11:18.266 --> 00:11:20.566
-Oh! Whoa!

179
00:11:20.633 --> 00:11:22.366
Kie!

180
00:11:22.433 --> 00:11:25.500
- Froakie.
- Ha, ha, Hawlucha!

181
00:11:25.566 --> 00:11:29.400
- Fro, Fro, Fro! Froakie!
- Ha, cha, ha, lu! Huh?

182
00:11:29.466 --> 00:11:33.400
Fro? Kie?

183
00:11:33.466 --> 00:11:35.233
- Hawlu-lu-lucha?
- Kie!

184
00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:37.266
You two are on the same team!

185
00:11:37.333 --> 00:11:39.366
You’re going to cover each other’s weak points

186
00:11:39.433 --> 00:11:43.466
and strengthen each other’s strong points, because you’re partners!

187
00:11:45.533 --> 00:11:47.633
- Froakie!
- Lucha! Lucha!

188
00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:57.433
- Kie. Fro.
- Cha, lu!

189
00:12:03.566 --> 00:12:08.266
Where am I? Who’s that Pokémon?

190
00:12:08.333 --> 00:12:11.033
Trevenant, the Elder Tree Pokémon.

191
00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.700
A Ghost and Grass type, Trevenant is able to control trees.

192
00:12:14.766 --> 00:12:18.066
It traps those who cause harm to the forest and never lets them escape.

193
00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:21.166
Come on! I’d never do anything to hurt the forest!

194
00:12:22.566 --> 00:12:26.500
Let me go! I’ve got to get back to my friends!

195
00:12:26.566 --> 00:12:29.966
- Huh?
- Let me go! Let me go!

196
00:12:30.033 --> 00:12:31.966
I said let me go!

197
00:12:34.733 --> 00:12:37.833
- Hawlucha, cha, ha!
- Froakie, Froakie!

198
00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.900
Froakie! Hawlucha!

199
00:12:39.966 --> 00:12:41.533
- Kie!
- Cha!

200
00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:45.400
You’ve got to watch out for the Confuse Ray!

201
00:12:45.466 --> 00:12:47.666
Fro! Froakie!

202
00:12:47.733 --> 00:12:51.366
-Cha!

203
00:12:51.433 --> 00:12:53.166
Whoa!

204
00:12:53.233 --> 00:12:57.966
Hawlucha! Trevenant’s a Ghost type! Fighting-type moves won’t work!

205
00:13:02.433 --> 00:13:04.900
Hey, Froakie! Help Hawlucha by using Bubble!

206
00:13:04.966 --> 00:13:07.733
Kie! Fro!

207
00:13:09.366 --> 00:13:13.466
- Hawlucha!
- Way to go! Great move!

208
00:13:13.533 --> 00:13:16.300
- Huh? Hey, thanks!
- Lucha.

209
00:13:19.366 --> 00:13:22.266
Okay! Let’s test our training!

210
00:13:22.333 --> 00:13:26.533
Remember, work together as partners. Use Super Flying Cut!

211
00:13:26.600 --> 00:13:29.700
- Ha!
- Fro, Froakie!

212
00:13:29.766 --> 00:13:31.966
- Kie!
- Lucha! Lucha! Lucha!

213
00:13:32.033 --> 00:13:35.166
Oh, man! Froakie, you’re on backwards!

214
00:13:35.233 --> 00:13:39.366
-Fro?

215
00:13:39.433 --> 00:13:41.200
Froakie, you okay?

216
00:13:41.266 --> 00:13:43.700
- Lucha? Lucha?
- Froakie! Kie!

217
00:13:43.766 --> 00:13:46.200
-Dodge that Will-O-Wisp!

218
00:13:46.266 --> 00:13:47.900
- Oh, no!

219
00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.800
-Oh, no, you don’t!

220
00:14:06.133 --> 00:14:09.133
- Froakie! Kie!
- Lu! Hawlucha?

221
00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:13.666
If that’s how it is, battle me, 'cause I’m going to protect my friends!

222
00:14:13.733 --> 00:14:15.100
Cha?

223
00:14:29.933 --> 00:14:32.400
- Guess you understand.
- Ha! Lucha!

224
00:14:32.466 --> 00:14:36.333
Trevenant, please tell me, why did you take me away in the first place?

225
00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:40.066
Trevenant! Trevenant!

226
00:14:40.133 --> 00:14:43.866
You want me to come with you?

227
00:14:53.966 --> 00:14:55.666
Sudo?

228
00:14:55.733 --> 00:14:57.733
Whoa! What’s going on?

229
00:14:57.800 --> 00:15:01.133
Sudowoodo and Bonsly. Who could’ve done this?

230
00:15:01.200 --> 00:15:05.733
Did you bring me here so I could help you get your friends down from there?

231
00:15:05.800 --> 00:15:08.633
- Trevenant.
- I get it now.

232
00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.833
Trevenant, leave it to me!

233
00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.700
Just a little bit more!

234
00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:27.633
Now I see. You needed my help to save them ‘cause the net’s electrified.

235
00:15:27.700 --> 00:15:30.133
- Pika, Pi!
- Ash!

236
00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.666
- Pikachu! Hey, guys!
- Pikachu!

237
00:15:33.733 --> 00:15:37.833
- You showed up at the perfect time!
- Ash, are you okay?

238
00:15:37.900 --> 00:15:41.333
Trevenant just wanted me to help get them out of that net.

239
00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:44.833
- So that’s what this is all about?
- What a cruel thing to do!

240
00:15:44.900 --> 00:15:48.433
- Pikachu, Iron Tail!
- Pika! Chu!

241
00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.866
Ha! Pika!

242
00:15:55.733 --> 00:15:58.500
- Pi!
- That’s great, Sudowoodo and Bonsly!

243
00:15:59.933 --> 00:16:01.366
Thanks, Pikachu!

244
00:16:02.733 --> 00:16:04.933
Pika!

245
00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:07.000
Pika!

246
00:16:07.066 --> 00:16:09.033
- Pikachu!
- Oh, no!

247
00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.300
Who did that?

248
00:16:10.366 --> 00:16:13.033
Prepare for trouble, if you don’t know by now.

249
00:16:13.100 --> 00:16:15.300
And make it double, we’ll tell you anyhow!

250
00:16:15.366 --> 00:16:17.800
To protect the world from devastation!

251
00:16:17.866 --> 00:16:20.600
To unite all people within our nation!

252
00:16:20.666 --> 00:16:23.500
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

253
00:16:23.566 --> 00:16:27.066
To extend our reach to the stars above!

254
00:16:27.133 --> 00:16:29.666
- Jessie!
- And James!

255
00:16:29.733 --> 00:16:32.500
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

256
00:16:32.566 --> 00:16:35.300
Surrender now or prepare for a forest fight!

257
00:16:35.366 --> 00:16:39.100
- Meowth, that’s right!
- Wobbuffet!

258
00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:44.766
- Team Rocket! Not you again!
- Well, the same goes for you!

259
00:16:44.833 --> 00:16:46.833
It’s all part of our groundbreaking,

260
00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.766
patent-pending, rare-Pokémon-stealing strategy!

261
00:16:49.833 --> 00:16:53.666
Of course. You’re the ones who set a trap for Sudowoodo and Bonsly!

262
00:16:53.733 --> 00:16:55.166
Wow. He thinks!

263
00:16:55.233 --> 00:16:58.766
- Give Pikachu back!
- That didn’t last long!

264
00:16:58.833 --> 00:17:02.033
Chi! Pika! Pika!

265
00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:05.000
Save your volts! We used an insulated net

266
00:17:05.066 --> 00:17:07.700
to catch the best twerp Pokémon we can get!

267
00:17:07.766 --> 00:17:11.633
- Pika! Pika!
- Pumpkaboo, get rid of that crew!

268
00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:14.200
Inkay! You too!

269
00:17:14.266 --> 00:17:16.333
- Inkay!
- Pumpkaboo!

270
00:17:16.400 --> 00:17:19.666
Froakie! Hawlucha! Time to work together!

271
00:17:19.733 --> 00:17:21.233
- Ha, cha!
- Froakie!

272
00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:25.400
- Pumpkaboo, Shadow Ball!
- Ha, ta, ta, ta!

273
00:17:25.466 --> 00:17:27.466
Dodge it!

274
00:17:27.533 --> 00:17:29.466
Froakie! Use your Frubbles!

275
00:17:30.666 --> 00:17:33.466
Froakie!

276
00:17:33.533 --> 00:17:35.766
Hawlucha! Flying Press, let’s go!

277
00:17:35.833 --> 00:17:38.566
Lucha!

278
00:17:38.633 --> 00:17:41.633
Pumpkaboo! Snap out of it!

279
00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.866
- Huh?
- Ka! Ka! Boo!

280
00:17:43.933 --> 00:17:47.600
Please! You should know fighting-type moves won’t work on Ghost types!

281
00:17:47.666 --> 00:17:50.433
- I’m one step ahead of you guys!
- One step?

282
00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.533
Froakie! Use Water Pulse!

283
00:17:53.600 --> 00:17:56.766
Kie, Fro!

284
00:17:58.433 --> 00:18:00.333
- Yippee!
- Na-na!

285
00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:04.133
Great strategy! They used Flying Press to leave Pumpkaboo open

286
00:18:04.200 --> 00:18:05.666
for a successful Water Pulse!

287
00:18:05.733 --> 00:18:08.566
The two of you sure make awesome partners!

288
00:18:08.633 --> 00:18:11.566
- Cha, cha, lu, ha!
- Froakie! Kie! Fro!

289
00:18:11.633 --> 00:18:13.166
- Lucha!
- Kie! Kie!

290
00:18:13.233 --> 00:18:16.000
Okay, Inkay! Tackle, now!

291
00:18:16.066 --> 00:18:18.733
Dodge it one more time!

292
00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.400
- Fro! Kie! Kie! Froakie.
- Lucha, cha!

293
00:18:21.466 --> 00:18:24.866
-Kie! Kie! Fro!

294
00:18:24.933 --> 00:18:26.233
Inkay, Psybeam!

295
00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:29.433
Inkay!

296
00:18:29.500 --> 00:18:31.166
- Oh!
- Froakie, no!

297
00:18:31.233 --> 00:18:35.633
Don’t worry. Froakie’s fine. That was just a decoy made out of Frubbles!

298
00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:37.966
- Ha!
- That was a Frubble fake?

299
00:18:38.033 --> 00:18:40.533
All right! Time for Super Flying Cut!

300
00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:44.200
Kie!

301
00:18:44.266 --> 00:18:45.733
Hawlucha, let her rip!

302
00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:47.033
Fro!

303
00:18:47.100 --> 00:18:49.933
- Hawlucha!
- Oh!

304
00:18:52.533 --> 00:18:55.900
Oh, yeah! Super Flying Cut worked just the way it’s supposed to!

305
00:18:55.966 --> 00:18:58.566
-Inkay, return!

306
00:18:58.633 --> 00:19:00.400
Wobbuffet!

307
00:19:00.466 --> 00:19:02.400
This isn’t looking good.

308
00:19:02.466 --> 00:19:06.800
Maybe we should shelve our strategy and call it a day. Ha!

309
00:19:06.866 --> 00:19:08.300
Ha!

310
00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.733
- All right!
- It’s Trevenant’s Wood Hammer!

311
00:19:20.733 --> 00:19:23.733
Pika! Pi!

312
00:19:23.800 --> 00:19:26.233
- Pika! Pika!
- Trevenant.

313
00:19:26.300 --> 00:19:29.433
- I guess we’re done.
- It wasn’t fun.

314
00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:30.766
So now we run.

315
00:19:30.833 --> 00:19:33.000
Pikachu! Thunderbolt, let’s go!

316
00:19:33.066 --> 00:19:36.766
Pikachu!

317
00:19:41.433 --> 00:19:44.833
We’re blasting off again!

318
00:19:44.900 --> 00:19:47.066
Wobbuffet!

319
00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.333
- Yay!
- They did it!

320
00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:51.533
- Na-na-na!
- And flawlessly!

321
00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.766
- Ha, cha!
- Froakie!

322
00:19:55.833 --> 00:19:59.533
- Lucha!
- Kie! Wow!

323
00:19:59.600 --> 00:20:02.366
Hawlucha, Froakie, you’re the best!

324
00:20:02.433 --> 00:20:04.733
- Tre! Trevenant.
- Wow!

325
00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:07.700
I’ve never seen more awesome partners than you two!

326
00:20:07.766 --> 00:20:10.633
Keep working together like that and it’ll be great!

327
00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:12.733
- Cha!
- Fro!

328
00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:15.266
Pika! Pika!

329
00:20:20.766 --> 00:20:23.566
Trevenant!

330
00:20:23.633 --> 00:20:25.433
Bye, bye! Bye, bye!

331
00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:29.600
Trevenant, Sudowoodo, Bonsly, take care of yourselves!

332
00:20:29.666 --> 00:20:31.333
We’ll see you again!

333
00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:32.533
Pika! Pika!

334
00:20:32.600 --> 00:20:34.766
- Bye, everyone!
- Bye-bye, everybody!

335
00:20:34.833 --> 00:20:37.433
Thanks to some amazing teamwork,

336
00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:41.500
Froakie, Hawlucha and Ash have helped some very grateful forest Pokémon.

337
00:20:41.566 --> 00:20:47.466
And soon, they'll be arriving in Shalour City, as the journey continues!
